Decisive test gen1-3: T1 (K1) and T3 (K3). numpy 2.5.3
delta = max|Q^H W Q - I|; span24 = max rel. residual of 5 random g in V_24 (p/pi_24); span12 = same for g = p/pi_12;
fA, fB = training-grid relative RMS LS error; minsvN = smallest nonzero singular value of the constraint matrix over all steps;
minkeptR = smallest kept relative singular value of the projected candidates; dims(last) = (rank of remainder, rank of constraint, block dim).

